[size=4][color=#00ffff]OVERVIEW[/color][/size]
Disables the camera that rotates around your character when you leave the game idle.
Works on new and existing saves.


[size=4][color=#00ffff]REQUIREMENTS[/color][/size]
Skyrim SE 1.5.97, Steam AE 1.6.1170 or 1.7.104, or GOG AE 1.6.1179. Skyrim VR is not supported.
[url=https://skse.silverlock.org/]SKSE[/url] and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/32444]Address Library[/url] matching your game version.


[size=4][color=#00ffff]ALTERNATIVES[/color][/size]
[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/61539]Disable Auto Vanity Mode[/url] - ESPFE alternative that changes INI settings. On existing saves it pushes the delay to 1 hour, on a new game it disables the vanity camera.
[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/131350]Sandbox When Idle[/url] - Lets your character wander around and interact with furniture when idle.


[size=4][color=#00ffff]SOURCE[/color][/size]
